@startuml
' Author: Eethanzyj
title Add Order: validate before changing data
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

actor Baker
participant ":BakerCli" as Cli
participant "<<class>>\nParser" as Parser
participant "<<class>>\nAddOrderParser" as AddParser

Baker -> Cli : add command
activate Cli
Cli -> Parser : parseAdd(input)
activate Parser
Parser -> AddParser : parse(input)
activate AddParser
note over Parser, AddParser
  Use FieldTokenizer for quoted values.
  Check prefixes, six non-blank fields,
  phone, strict date and cake size.
end note
alt invalid input
  AddParser --> Parser : throws CakeQueueException
  Parser --> Cli : propagates exception
  Cli --> Baker : Error: <message>
  note over Cli, AddParser
    No ID generation, order creation or save.
    The CLI continues with the next command.
  end note
else valid input
  AddParser --> Parser : details: AddOrderDetails
  Parser --> Cli : details: AddOrderDetails
  note over Cli, AddParser : Next: create the order (separate diagram).
end
deactivate AddParser
deactivate Parser
deactivate Cli
@enduml
